From ff35e1d42837f316dd395e95b75f2a046739b856 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 06:46:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] NEMO TKE: [ocean] nemo_parameters = "glorys12" preset
 (GLORYS12's NEMO 3.1 TKE defaults) and two 30-day configs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

nemo_tke_presets.jl: "reference" (NEMO 3.6-4.x reference namelist, as before) and "glorys12" (zdftke2.F90 of NEMO 3.1:
surface TKE 3.75 u★², surface mixing length 0.4 m, minimum length 0.1 m, Prandtl number max(0.1, 0.2/max(0.2, Ri)),
background 1e-4 / 1e-5 m²/s, emin 0.7071e-6), and nemo_tke_closure(), which loads the closure if needed and refuses an
older one loaded in the same process. nemo_tke_vertical_diffusivity.jl updated as in Oceananigans fjp/nemo-tke (surface
floor ℓ₀ᵐⁱⁿ). Configs config_sep2005_30d_nemo_glorys12_lim2.toml and ..._nz100.toml.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvoXen2vZSP4ZrEkbYa
